<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for making contact with us regarding
your experience at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} Airport on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">We want all our customers to have a
comfortable and pleasant journey from the moment you arrive at the airport. You
should receive professional, courteous and helpful service from all of our
team, so I was very disappointed to learn about the attitude of our<b>&nbsp;<i>-Qantas
Club/Business/First Lounge-</i>&nbsp;</b>staff.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">I would like to assure you that your
experience was not the service we strive to deliver. So that we can learn from
your feedback, I have forwarded a copy of your experience to our Lounge
Management in {!Case.Arrival_City__c}. Your comments will be used to improve
the performance of the staff concerned.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i>-If requesting follow up add:-</i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">However, as I’m sure you can appreciate, I
cannot advise you of any internal investigation or discipline outcomes due to
privacy legislation.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">I’m grateful for you taking the time to get in
touch with us about this, and I hope that we can welcome you in to our lounge
again soon.<br><br><br>Kind regards<br><br>{!User.FirstName}<br><br>Qantas Customer Care<br><br><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><span style="color: white;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>